                        <h2 class="title">家校同心，静待花开——绍兴一中教育集团举行各年段家长会</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2025年04月30日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=21357"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
